                                        "sense_id": "28b1af82-1816-3a97-a40d-9329a2eef918",
                                        "entry_id": "ae60c371-4990-3c53-acb8-36136494ff5c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A polyhedron with parallel ends of the same polygonal shape and size, the other faces being parallelogram-shaped sides.",
                                            "An object having the shape of a geometrical prism (sense 1)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e086fe9-73e3-3376-92d5-8dc8e229c30c",
                                        "entry_id": "ae60c371-4990-3c53-acb8-36136494ff5c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A polyhedron with parallel ends of the same polygonal shape and size, the other faces being parallelogram-shaped sides.",
                                            "A cutting (“open passage at a level lower than the surrounding terrain, dug for a canal, railway, or road to go through”) or an embankment shaped like a prism (sense 1) or a number of prisms, such that its volume can be easily calculated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "67683894-9bff-3b9d-8a3b-8aac4ac799a5",
                                        "entry_id": "ae60c371-4990-3c53-acb8-36136494ff5c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A polyhedron with parallel ends of the same polygonal shape and size, the other faces being parallelogram-shaped sides.",
                                            "A crystal in which the faces are parallel to the vertical axis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "64852a57-ecd4-3157-b747-64f8347390df",
                                        "entry_id": "ae60c371-4990-3c53-acb8-36136494ff5c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A polyhedron with parallel ends of the same polygonal shape and size, the other faces being parallelogram-shaped sides.",
                                            "A transparent block in the shape of a prism (sense 1), typically with triangular ends, used to reflect or refract light."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "225cff9b-4296-4eb6-9424-bb5e2382cfff",
                                                "sense_id": "64852a57-ecd4-3157-b747-64f8347390df",
                                                "text": "[page 13] One of theſe Parts [of a piece of black paper] I painted vvith a red Colour and the other vvith a blevv. […] This Paper I vievved through a Priſm of ſolid Glaſs, vvhoſe tvvo Sides through vvhich the Light paſſed to the Eye vvere plane and vvell poliſhed, and contained an Angle of about Sixty Degrees: vvhich Angle I call the refracting Angle of the Priſm. […] [page 17] Theſe Experiments may ſuffice for the Colours of Natural Bodies. For in the Colours made by the Refraction of Priſms this Propoſition vvill appear by the Experiments vvhich are novv to follovv in the next Propoſition."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ba630ac-de0a-4985-be12-e7e9aaa79fd2",
                                                "sense_id": "64852a57-ecd4-3157-b747-64f8347390df",
                                                "text": "Here, avvful [Isaac] Newton, the diſſolving clouds / Form, fronting on the ſun, thy ſhovvery priſm; / And to the ſage-inſtructed eye unfold / The various tvvine of light, by thee diſclos'd / From the vvhite mingling maze."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "95c9424d-14d8-3d19-898d-98b404b6a5d6",
                                        "entry_id": "ae60c371-4990-3c53-acb8-36136494ff5c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A polyhedron with parallel ends of the same polygonal shape and size, the other faces being parallelogram-shaped sides.",
                                            "A transparent block in the shape of a prism (sense 1), typically with triangular ends, used to reflect or refract light.",
                                            "A spectrum produced by light being refracted through a prism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6012f1e1-19aa-4767-b5a1-b864ce16566e",
                                                "sense_id": "95c9424d-14d8-3d19-898d-98b404b6a5d6",
                                                "text": "The beams, that thro' the Oriel shine, / Make prisms in every carven glass, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3084279f-7260-3b27-b91a-97102c478d41",
                                        "entry_id": "ae60c371-4990-3c53-acb8-36136494ff5c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A retroreflector (“device which reflects light back to its source with minimal scattering”) which is usually attached to a surveying pole as a target for a total station which emits a light beam at the device and calculates how long it takes to be reflected back in order to measure distance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e215652-8514-389e-8711-43d6c2cc1788",
                                        "entry_id": "ae60c371-4990-3c53-acb8-36136494ff5c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A perspective that colours one's perception."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8eb95e29-c795-464d-9620-e3fd8756d36f",
                                                "sense_id": "3e215652-8514-389e-8711-43d6c2cc1788",
                                                "text": "I had surveyed the landscape through the prism of poetry, which tinged every object with the hues of the rainbow."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7671657-d178-49c5-b83d-4ec5c318e16d",
                                                "sense_id": "3e215652-8514-389e-8711-43d6c2cc1788",
                                                "text": "It is a simple fact that many outside the Abu Dhabi-owned club will always view their triumph through the prism of the charges of 115 financial breaches brought against them by the Premier League, charges they fiercely deny."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0240e89d-2923-486e-828b-87431a9452bd",
                        "source_entry_id": "18717947-949e-39d1-9e47-738213ed865e",
                        "target_lang_word": "prisme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "prisme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c57c0ca0-e519-33e4-bc67-417d9fdc1016",
                                        "entry_id": "0c67023c-ea85-304b-9056-b70fbf2ae6ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Polyèdre ayant pour bases deux polygones égaux et parallèles, dont les côtés homologues sont unis par des parallélogrammes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb432a53-6cb0-4286-aa0f-6276323f4604",
                                                "sense_id": "c57c0ca0-e519-33e4-bc67-417d9fdc1016",
                                                "text": "Les physiciens, et notamment M. Bravais, ont démontré que les halos et les parhélies se produisent par suite de l’action exercée sur les rayons solaires traversant des cirrhus composés de petits prismes de glace."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a52eb40-342b-451a-aae2-e1705cdb51f3",
                                                "sense_id": "c57c0ca0-e519-33e4-bc67-417d9fdc1016",
                                                "text": "L’acide tellurique cristallise en gros prismes hexagonaux qui contiennent trois équivalents d’eau."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88980117-bbcd-46e4-8a6f-c6305188f891",
                                                "sense_id": "c57c0ca0-e519-33e4-bc67-417d9fdc1016",
                                                "text": "Nous comprenons de ce fait pourquoi, pendant des siècles, nos maisons ont été des parallélépipèdes, parfois surmontés d’un prisme : parce que ces formes classiques sont faciles à construire et parce que nous n’avions pas les moyens nécessaires pour calculer des bâtiments plus alambiqués."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ea30515-eca0-33d5-9454-5deb027983f3",
                                        "entry_id": "0c67023c-ea85-304b-9056-b70fbf2ae6ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Instrument d’optique qui sert à réfracter et à décomposer la lumière et qui est un prisme triangulaire de verre blanc ou de cristal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially",
                                            "physical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6f04edb-53a7-47a9-a07d-16cb6a3385ae",
                                                "sense_id": "8ea30515-eca0-33d5-9454-5deb027983f3",
                                                "text": "Les nuages, diaprés et à demi transparents, affectent la forme d'immenses draperies suspendues à la voûte du ciel, où toutes les couleurs du prisme se fondent dans une divine harmonie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54ed21db-3194-3f54-a270-e64fd3939594",
                                        "entry_id": "0c67023c-ea85-304b-9056-b70fbf2ae6ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ensemble de préjugés et de passions. → voir filtre"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "781a141a-a5a6-4b98-bde5-638606d8c7cd",
                                                "sense_id": "54ed21db-3194-3f54-a270-e64fd3939594",
                                                "text": "Bientôt nous perdons de vue la dernière île, et nous voguons vers cette Islande qui doit nous apparaître dans deux jours et que nous entrevoyons déjà à travers le prisme de l'imagination."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48343035-1c74-4890-887d-c4be70bcd0fb",
                                                "sense_id": "54ed21db-3194-3f54-a270-e64fd3939594",
                                                "text": "Les réformes structurelles sur le marché de l’emploi sont soigneusement présentées sous le prisme positif du travail, dont le but premier est de doper l’activité des entreprises qui embaucheront et réduiront alors le chômage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e18ddfc-9822-4945-87cb-9caf3f7bd664",
                                                "sense_id": "54ed21db-3194-3f54-a270-e64fd3939594",
                                                "text": "Je me limiterai à mentionner les prismes (pour ne pas dire biais) principaux de nos deux plus grands médias."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6533e20a-46db-499d-9161-e1636a798873",
                                                "sense_id": "54ed21db-3194-3f54-a270-e64fd3939594",
                                                "text": "J’ai vu Tahiti trop délicieuse et trop étrange, à travers le prisme enchanteur de mon extrême jeunesse…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
